      "fontSize": 14,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b1m",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "SOURCES OF TRUTH (MySQL)\n  users · agents (prompt, models, chatHistoryConf, summaryMemory) · devices · model configs\n  sys_params · sys_dict_type/data · timbres · voice_clone · chat_history · chat_audio\n\nREDIS HOLDINGS (all derived or short-lived, 27 keys)\n  caches: sys:params · sys:dict:data:* · model:* · timbre:* · device:address_book:all · server:config\n  tokens: sys:captcha:* · sms:Validate:Code:* · ota:activation:* · ota:id:* · counters\n\nRUNTIME FACT: only manager-api touches MySQL/Redis in normal operation.\nxiaozhi-server reaches them over HTTP (config pull, history report, summary).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 210345951,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "SOURCES OF TRUTH (MySQL)\n  users · agents (prompt, models, chatHistoryConf, summaryMemory) · devices · model configs\n  sys_params · sys_dict_type/data · timbres · voice_clone · chat_history · chat_audio\n\nREDIS HOLDINGS (all derived or short-lived, 27 keys)\n  caches: sys:params · sys:dict:data:* · model:* · timbre:* · device:address_book:all · server:config\n  tokens: sys:captcha:* · sms:Validate:Code:* · ota:activation:* · ota:id:* · counters\n\nRUNTIME FACT: only manager-api touches MySQL/Redis in normal operation.\nxiaozhi-server reaches them over HTTP (config pull, history report, summary).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794759173811,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1344964075,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
